There is no map-veto feature yet, so the landing page's Practice list
and the sign-up page no longer promise one. The randomizer's build
picker pointed at a "Settings → Builds" tab that no longer exists and
named an internal catalog; it now says "Custom builds in the menu" and
describes the built-in builds in plain words.

